The ids authenticate accepts, from an initialize answer whose auth methods are
ACP's union, read by one emitted function that the gate uses too: the agent
ids and an Unknown entry's string id, in order and once each, and no id a
terminal entry names. The gate refuses a terminal id first, and any id the
list lacks with ErrUnadvertisedAuthMethod naming the list, or "none"
(0050-PLAN-auth-method-ids-and-the-prompt-result-for-issue-14.md, phase 1).

